                <name>Extreme Heat Zones</name>
                <Placemark id="149">
                    <name>Indus Valley</name>
                    <description>Indus Valley heat zone — routinely exceeds 50°C. Wet-bulb temperatures approach survivability threshold during peak events. APPROXIMATE — Narrative-derived polygon. Replace with data-driven geometry when source dataset becomes available. See: 2050-snapshot/domains/climate.md#heatwaves</description>
