                <Placemark id="156">
                    <name>Persian Gulf</name>
                    <description>Persian Gulf heat zone — wet-bulb temperatures exceed human survivability threshold (35°C) for brief periods. Outdoor labor lethal without artificial cooling. APPROXIMATE — Narrative-derived polygon. Replace with data-driven geometry when source dataset becomes available. See: 2050-snapshot/domains/climate.md#heatwaves</description>
                    <gx:CascadingStyle><Style><LineStyle><color>ff55b0b0</color><width>0.5</width></LineStyle><PolyStyle><color>4055b0b0</color></PolyStyle></Style></gx:CascadingStyle><Polygon id="155">
