                <Placemark id="178">
                    <name>Western US/Canada</name>
                    <description>Western US/Canada fire regime — area burned annually increased 2-3x. Fire seasons 30-50 days longer. Pyrocumulonimbus clouds inject smoke into stratosphere. APPROXIMATE — Narrative-derived polygon. Replace with data-driven geometry when source dataset becomes available. See: 2050-snapshot/domains/climate.md#wildfire</description>
