                <name>Arctic Resource Zones</name>
                <Placemark id="322">
                    <name>Russian Arctic Sector</name>
                    <description>Russian Arctic sector — extensive Northern Sea Route (ice-free 5-7 months/year). Nuclear-powered icebreakers based in Murmansk. Permafrost thaw affects 65% of Russian territory. Oil, gas, and mineral resources. APPROXIMATE — Narrative-derived polygon. Replace with data-driven geometry when source dataset becomes available. See: 2050-snapshot/domains/climate.md#arctic-resource-competition</description>
                    <gx:CascadingStyle><Style><LineStyle><color>ff55b0b0</color><width>0.5</width></LineStyle><PolyStyle><color>4055b0b0</color></PolyStyle></Style></gx:CascadingStyle><Polygon id="321">
